 "description": "List the newest wholesale items uploaded by Dongdaemun (Seoul) stalls on apMZoomAI (\uc571\uc5e0\uc90cAI) within the last N hours (default 24, up to 168), newest first, at most 3 per stall. Optional filters: building key (see list_buildings) and category (e.g. dress, knit, jeans, outer, shoes, bags). Returns item name, photos, category, stall location and an apMZoomAI link. No prices are provided; the link shows price and ordering details.",
